                      Application accepted
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#111827;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">
                      Hello Amina Benali, I hope you&#x27;re doing well.
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">
                      Congratulations! We&#x27;re delighted to let you know that
                      your application has been <strong>accepted</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">
                      We&#x27;re really excited to have you take part in the
                      event and can&#x27;t wait to see what you&#x27;ll bring to
                      it.
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">
                      You&#x27;ll soon be added to the event&#x27;s Discord
                      group. That&#x27;s where we&#x27;ll share important
                      updates and all event-related information, so keep an eye
                      on it.
                    </p>
                    <p
                      style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#374151;margin:0 0 16px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0">
                      Welcome aboard, and see you soon!
                    </p>
